# NOTE: uv.lock is deliberately NOT ignored. It is tracked so that dev and CI
# environments are byte-for-byte reproducible. It does not affect what users
# install (pip resolves from pyproject.toml) and is excluded from the published
# sdist via [tool.hatch.build.targets.sdist] in pyproject.toml.
